  "notes": [
    "Exact product documents fetched independently in this runtime pass; original historical source identities remain in knowledge records.",
    "U121-B-V11 schematic FPC U4 verifies SIO_C=G12,SIO_D=G14,D0..D7=G32/35/34/5/39/18/36/19,PCLK21,HREF26,VSYNC22,RESET15,PWDN pulled down R31 10k.",
    "U017 A and B differ: the default board is explicitly A as shown by the manufacturer quick-start card; m5stack-u017-b selects B. U017-PCBA is B pinout from its own document.",
    "U007 uses D0 G17 and LED G16. All UnitCAM variants use D0 G32.",
    "Only U121-B-V11 uses OV3660; U121 and U121-B use OV2640. Timer U082/U082-X/U082-F use OV3660.",
    "Unknown PSRAM stays unknown for U007/U109/U109-X/U109-B. Zero-PSRAM is a diagnostic runtime configuration, not a capacity claim.",
    "All boards currently use an externally powered USB/PoE digital subset. Lens optics, exposure/ISP, radio, Ethernet and physical battery power require separate acceptance."
  ],
